"coordinates":[137.16232154,34.86526595]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"parks_playgrounds","name":"三ヶ根南公園","category":"nature","address":"額田郡幸田町","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"23501","municipality_pref":"愛知県","municipality_name":"幸田町","municipality_code_method":"nearest_centroid"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[137.17881812,34.83419549]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"parks_playgrounds","name":"幸田町とぼね運動公園","category":"nature","address":"額田郡幸田町","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"23501","municipality_pref":"愛知県","municipality_name":"幸田町","municipality_code_method":"nearest_centroid"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[137.18730146,34.85917678]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"parks_playgrounds","name":"幸田中央公園","category":"nature","address":"額田郡幸田町","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"23501","municipality_pref":"愛知県","municipality_name":"幸田町","municipality_code_method":"nearest_centroid"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[137.16782254,34.86448451]}}],"display_comment_original":"幸田町周辺には、近世村の記憶として坂崎村、久保田村、鷲田村などの旧村名が見える。 この地域には寺社や信仰の場、古墳や貝塚に関わる場所が見え、青塚古墳、浄土寺、山寺古墓のような地点が探索の入口になる。 現地では坂崎村、久保田村ゆかりの旧境石標や村の歴史案内板が手がかりになりそうだ。さらに田・新田・用水の地名が多く、土地改良碑や用水記念碑が見つかる可能性がある。水辺の暮らしや堤防整備の歴史を示す案内板に加え、治水碑や河川改修の記念碑が狙い目になる。","story_enrichment":{"samurai_priority_people":["松平家忠","平岩親吉","夏目吉信"],"notable_people":["松平家忠","平岩親吉","夏目吉信","26代木村庄之助"],"honorary_citizens":[],"tourism_landmarks":["大草城","深溝城","安国寺","円宗寺","岩松寺","西方寺- 松平氏2代松平泰親の長男教然が建立。","三光院","浄土寺"],"specialties":[],"food_culture":[],"historical_domains":[],"heian_place_names":[],"japan_search_support":["島原藩主深溝松平家墓所 https://jpsearch.go.jp/item/bunka-208244"],"enrichment_sources":["https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%B9%B8%E7%94%B0%E7%94%BA","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q6788035","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q849070","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q6980311","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11518848","https://jpsearch.go.jp/csearch/jps-cros